  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> cân tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là đường trung tuyến nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math> cũng là đường cao. Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></semantics></math> km.<br>Xét <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math>, có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra chiều dài cây cầu là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math> km.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/254e912027e44b9d584b86b929a908d3e94b8f2e6fabbfc6f71fafcfcdae9d40.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
